  "description": {
   "en": "Shoko Sakura attends a marriage activity party at the invitation of her best friend, Miho, where she meets a refreshingly charming young man, Hitoshi Mayumura. Later, she unexpectedly runs into him near her office, and when he moves into the apartment next door, she can't help but feel a sense of fate... However, behind his friendly facade, Mayumura hides a dangerously dark side! Under the guise of coincidence, Mayumura has been stalking Shoko all along! His madness steadily creeps closer... her peaceful daily life begins to erode... and an unfathomable fear closes in on Shoko!",
   "ja": "紗倉祥子は、親友の美穂に誘われた婚活パーティーで、爽やかな好青年・眉村仁と出会う。\nその後、会社近くで再会し、さらには同じマンションの隣室に引っ越してきたことから運命的なものを感じるが……眉村には爽やかな表の顔とは別に、危険すぎる裏の顔があった！　眉村は偶然を装い、祥子を付け狙っていたのだ!!\n着々と忍び寄る狂気…蝕まれていく平穏な日常…底知れぬ恐怖が祥子を襲う!!"
  },
